BT /F1 10 Tf 72 740 Td (PAY AND BENEFITS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 727 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 714 Td (5. Salary. 5.1 Your salary is 68,500 pounds a year, paid in twelve equal instalments by bank) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 701 Td (transfer on the 28th day of each month, or on the last working day before it if the 28th is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 688 Td (not a working day. 5.2 Your salary is reviewed each April, with any change taking effect) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 675 Td (from 1 April. A review does not mean your salary will increase. 5.3 The Company may deduct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 662 Td (from your pay any money you owe it, including overpaid salary, unreturned equipment and any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 649 Td (holiday taken in excess of your entitlement when you leave.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 636 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 623 Td (5.4 You are not entitled to paid overtime. Your salary takes account of the occasional need) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 610 Td (to work beyond your normal hours. 5.5 You are eligible for the Company's discretionary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 597 Td (annual bonus scheme. Any bonus is worth up to ten per cent of your salary, depends on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 584 Td (Company's results and your own performance, and is paid in June. You must be employed and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 571 Td (not under notice on the payment date to receive a bonus.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 558 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 545 Td (6. Expenses. 6.1 The Company will repay reasonable expenses you incur while carrying out) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 532 Td (your duties, in line with the expenses policy. 6.2 Claims must be submitted through the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 519 Td (expenses system with receipts within 60 days of the expense being incurred. Claims submitted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 506 Td (later may not be paid. 6.3 Travel between your home and your normal place of work is not a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 493 Td (business expense.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 480 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 467 Td (6.4 Pension. The Company will enrol you in its workplace pension scheme with Harrow Life in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 454 Td (line with automatic enrolment law. The Company contributes 5 per cent of your basic salary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 441 Td (and you contribute 4 per cent, by salary sacrifice unless you choose otherwise. You may opt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 428 Td (out of the scheme within one month of being enrolled. 6.5 Other benefits. After probation) Tj ET
