BT /F1 10 Tf 72 740 Td (HOURS, PROBATION AND NOTICE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 727 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 714 Td (7. Probation. 7.1 The first six months of your employment are a probation period. During) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 701 Td (probation your manager will meet you at least monthly to review your progress. 7.2 The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 688 Td (Company may extend probation by up to three months if it needs more time to assess you, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 675 Td (will tell you in writing before the original period ends. 7.3 During probation either you or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 662 Td (the Company may end your employment by giving one week's notice in writing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 649 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 636 Td (8. Hours of work. 8.1 Your normal working hours are 37.5 hours a week, Monday to Friday,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 623 Td (with an unpaid lunch break of one hour each day. 8.2 You may choose your start and finish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 610 Td (times, as long as you are available during the core hours of 10am to 4pm and work your full) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 597 Td (hours each week. 8.3 You agree that the 48 hour average weekly limit in the Working Time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 584 Td (Regulations does not apply to you. You may withdraw this agreement by giving three months') Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 571 Td (written notice.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 558 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 545 Td (9. Notice after probation. 9.1 After you complete probation, you must give the Company four) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 532 Td (weeks' written notice to end your employment. 9.2 After probation, the Company must give you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 519 Td (at least four weeks' written notice to end your employment. Once you have five years of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 506 Td (continuous employment, the notice the Company must give you increases by one week for each) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 493 Td (further complete year of employment, up to a maximum of twelve weeks. 9.3 Nothing in this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 480 Td (clause stops the Company from ending your employment without notice for gross misconduct.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 467 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 454 Td (9.4 The Company may decide to pay you basic salary in place of all or part of your notice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 441 Td (period. 9.5 During all or part of your notice period the Company may put you on garden) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 428 Td (leave. While on garden leave you remain employed and paid, but you must not attend work or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 415 Td (contact clients or colleagues about work unless the Company asks you to, and you must not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 402 Td (start work for anyone else. 9.6 On your last day you must return all Company property,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 389 Td (documents and data, and delete any Company information held on your own devices.) Tj ET
