BT /F1 10 Tf 72 740 Td (SICKNESS AND FAMILY LEAVE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 727 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 714 Td (13. Reporting sickness. 13.1 If you are unable to work because of sickness or injury, you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 701 Td (must tell your manager by phone or video call as soon as possible, and no later than 9.30am) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 688 Td (on your first day of absence. A message or email is only acceptable if you cannot call. 13.2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 675 Td (You must keep your manager informed of how you are and when you expect to return. 13.3 For) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 662 Td (absences of up to seven calendar days you must complete a self-certification form on the HR) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 649 Td (system on the day you return to work. For absences of more than seven calendar days you must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 636 Td (provide a fit note from your doctor covering the whole of the absence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 623 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 610 Td (14. Sick pay. 14.1 You are entitled to Statutory Sick Pay if you meet the conditions for it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 597 Td (14.2 Once you have completed probation, the Company will also pay your full basic salary,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 584 Td (including any Statutory Sick Pay, for up to four weeks of sickness absence in any rolling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 571 Td (period of twelve months, and half of your basic salary for a further four weeks. 14.3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 558 Td (Company sick pay is discretionary and may be withheld if you do not follow the reporting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 545 Td (rules or if the absence results from a sport or activity done professionally.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 532 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 519 Td (14.4 The Company may ask you to see an occupational health adviser or a doctor it nominates,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 506 Td (at its expense, and you agree to the report being shared with the Company. 14.5 If you are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 493 Td (often absent or absent for a long time, the Company will meet you to discuss support and any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 480 Td (reasonable adjustments before taking any other step.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 467 Td ( ) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 454 Td (15. Family leave. 15.1 You are entitled to maternity, paternity, adoption, shared parental) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 441 Td (and parental bereavement leave and pay as set out in the law and in the family leave policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 428 Td (in the Staff Handbook, which in some cases is more generous than the law. 15.2 You may take) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 415 Td (reasonable unpaid time off to deal with an emergency involving a dependant. 15.3 You may) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 402 Td (also take up to five days of paid carer's leave a year after probation.) Tj ET
